@base = http://localhost:8080

### Liveness
GET {{base}}/health/live

### Readiness
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Overview, indexed range and last RPC observation
GET {{base}}/api/v1/overview

### Ledgers (use next_cursor exactly as returned for the next request)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/ledgers?limit=5

### Transactions
GET {{base}}/api/v1/transactions?limit=5

### Captured Testnet ledger; available after fixture replay
GET {{base}}/api/v1/ledgers/5569284

### Typed search
GET {{base}}/api/v1/search?q=5569284

### Validation error
GET {{base}}/api/v1/ledgers?limit=-1

### OpenAPI 3.0.3
GET {{base}}/openapi.json

### Observed token contracts
GET {{base}}/api/v1/assets?limit=20

### Decoded committed token movements
GET {{base}}/api/v1/transfers?limit=20

### Native SAC metadata, creation evidence, related transactions and events
GET {{base}}/api/v1/contracts/CDLZFC3SYJYDZT7K67VZ75HPJVIEUVNIXF47ZG2FB2RMQQVU2HHGCYSC

### Successful indexed transactions, with inclusive ledger bounds
GET {{base}}/api/v1/transactions?status=success&min_ledger=5569284&max_ledger=5569284&limit=5

### Committed transfer events (first symbol topic)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/events?event_name=transfer&event_type=contract&limit=10

### Committed transaction-level fees/refunds, including failed transactions
GET {{base}}/api/v1/events?event_scope=transaction&event_name=fee&limit=10

### Operation events only
GET {{base}}/api/v1/events?event_scope=operation&limit=10

### Movements of the native SAC
GET {{base}}/api/v1/transfers?asset=CDLZFC3SYJYDZT7K67VZ75HPJVIEUVNIXF47ZG2FB2RMQQVU2HHGCYSC

### Bounded indexed transaction activity (fixed 120-ledger maximum; no limit parameter)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/activity/transactions

### Failed transaction counts in the same bounded window
GET {{base}}/api/v1/activity/transactions?status=failed

### Fungible movement counts by kind; amounts are not summed
GET {{base}}/api/v1/activity/transfers

### Observed NFT collections and snapshot counts
GET {{base}}/api/v1/nfts/collections?limit=20

### Supported NFT movements, separate from fungible amounts
GET {{base}}/api/v1/nfts/transfers?limit=20

### Exact NFT identifier zero, potentially across multiple collections
GET {{base}}/api/v1/nfts/transfers?token_id=0
